    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract class for applying environmental patches to a spatial tree of terrain cells. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class extends <ref refid="class_patch_applicator" kindref="compound">PatchApplicator</ref> and adds functionality specific to the spatial tree hierarchy (<ref refid="class_spatial_tree_terrain_cell" kindref="compound">SpatialTreeTerrainCell</ref>). It provides an interface for applying patches recursively down the tree. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
